Z||000000||Ronnie||03-27-2001||11:58 PM||||To all that could make it. There is a car show this coming Sunday at Dado's in Braselton off I-85 from 1-5 p.m. They usually have 100+ cars at they're shows. This is their first kickoff show of the year. Thought it would be fun to have a few Fieros show up!!! E-mail me for more info if you'd like to make a showing.<BR>Braselton is about 30 miles N.E. of Atlanta off I-85.<BR>Brought to you by the Madison County Cruisers<P>------------------<BR>Black '86GT 4spd ,leather int.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero2_1_3.jpg"> ||||reg||6
